/*
  SignalChartPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0266 · SignalChartPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SignalChartPanel` resolves (table "SignalChartPanel") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact set of strings the web source resolves through
  `t()` (features/telemetry/components/SignalChartPanel.tsx + the grid empty key
  from SmallMultiplesChart). The web uses the English string itself as the key; the
  native port assigns a stable dotted key carrying that exact English value, so the
  rendered copy is identical while staying translatable. The remainder backs the
  native state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / error
  chrome) and the accessibility summaries.
*/

/* --- Keys from the web source (parity) --- */
